---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Gallery
description: Browse handmade wood art from Gifted Hands Creations — American flag art, wooden heart décor, and custom engraved keepsakes.
permalink: /gallery/
---
<section class="section section--collections">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__heading">
      <h1>Gallery</h1>
      <p>Three collections, all made by hand. These are portfolio pieces — reach out through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> if something catches your eye.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="collection-grid">
      {% for item in portfolio %}
      <div class="collection-card">
        <a href="/gallery/{{ item.slug }}/" class="collection-card__image">
          <img src="{{ item.heroImage }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="800" height="600">
        </a>
        <h2><a href="/gallery/{{ item.slug }}/">{{ item.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ item.shortDescription }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
